  "label": "The Black Ranger's costume is mapped to the green-skinned ape-like figure",
  "description": "The text 'do you really think they were just talking about his costume?' in the top panel sets up a false equivalence, implying that the Black Ranger's costume is being compared to the green-skinned ape-like figure in the bottom panel. The meme uses the ape-like figure to visually represent the racist trope of equating Black people with primates, which is the core of the hateful analogy.",
